Giacomo's is a restaurant in the central hub of the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], among the shared buildings about the foot of the tower that carries the strider's gyroscope. It serves good couscous. It has stood empty since the strider halted, with no wait staff or cooks, only the cloths left on its tables from better days.

The whole central circle, Giacomo's with it, was made neutral ground in the parley between the Party and [[Org/Amber Call/People/Silven Grayson|Silven Grayson]]: a place of no fighting, owned by nobody, where either side may leave notes and send messengers to collect them.
